    "detailed_description": "THE STORY<br>As researcher Lenor Donuk, explore an entire country apartment by apartment, and find a way to save the country from the KUBIK26 virus.<br>He steals the right clothes so as not to be recognized by citizens and cameras scattered around the country.<br><br>ENERGY<br>Find the necessary food in the fridges to be able to run and escape when necessary.<br><br>OBJECTS<br>Piverantum hides many useful objects that allow you to advance in the story.<br><br>MEANS OF TRANSPORT<br>The country hides something very useful!<br><br>SHOPS<br>Enter the shops to buy useful items or eat something.<br><br>BAR<br>Try your luck by playing some money in the slot.<br><br>COLLECT INFORMATION<br>Collect information from citizens' diaries that you find in houses, they will indicate where you can find useful clothes and items.<br><br>A MISTERIOUS FRIEND<br>Thanks to some help, you will be guided in the hope of stealing from the PIVERDEX company the elements needed to create the vaccine.<br><br>OVER 120 EXPLOREABLE APARTMENTS<br><br>Go house to house looking for objects and clothes to make yourself less noticed.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441620/extras/c507a1673bbec5187428cd42f26a6623.avif?t=1714593684\" /></span><br><br>CITIZENS AND POLICEMAN OF PIVERANTUM<br><br>Women, men, old people, guard dogs and policemen, they will hunt you down.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441620/extras/de3d50077e2a95a99348122cfc92e4d7.avif?t=1714593684\" /></span><br><br>5 NEIGHBORHOODS<br><br>Find the right clothes for each area of the country, the citizens will hardly recognize you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441620/extras/3a634417bdd4a91ac3feee42f804dd6c.avif?t=1714593684\" /></span>",
